flowchart TD
 A[Text question] --> B[Validate session and message]
 B --> C[Intent + conversation context]
 C -->|new source| D[POST /api/query]
 C -->|same topic| I[Reuse current evidence]
 D --> E[Safety triage]
 E --> F[MiniLM + lexical passage retrieval]
 F --> G[Transcript windows + CLIP frame scoring]
 G --> H[Extract cues, frames and clip]
 H --> J[Voyager structured backend claims]
 J --> I
 I --> K[Select relevant cues + checked references]
 K --> L[Generate, verify and bounded repair]
 L --> M[Chat + inline sources + optional video]
